+construction of the shape at 8192-wide chunks, ~227 rows/expert, running
+at 12–18 % FLOPS on Triton) vs our register-bound WS tiles, and (2) their
+fp16-WMMA indexer + FlashMLA-style attention kernels, which our contracts
+(indexer top-k double; chunked/tokenwise byte identity anchoring the CPU
+oracle) do not admit as-is.
+
+## Fix round 1 (post-review)
+
