+env has no `GUFO_TBSTREAM_TRACE_MS`). `tests/functional/glm53_serving_prefill.py`
+(new this phase) calibrates the ladder.py filler blocks over two sends
+(39.700 tokens/block, base 87.0 tokens), builds a ~3.4K-token archive document
+per run with a distinct first line so every measured prompt is a cold prefix
+(`cached_tokens = 0`), sends it streamed with `return_progress`, and computes
+fresh-tokens / server `prefill_ms` and fresh-tokens / client wall to the last
+`prompt_progress` event.
+
+| run | fresh tokens | chunks | server prefill_ms | client prefill wall | tok/s (server) | tok/s (client) |
+| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |
+| 1 | 3405 | 4 (max 1024) | 45409.0 | 45.42 s | **74.99** | 74.97 |
+| 2 | 3395 | 4 (max 1024) | 45299.8 | 45.31 s | **74.95** | 74.93 |
+| 3 | 3397 | 4 (max 1024) | 45385.5 | 45.39 s | **74.85** | 74.84 |
+
+Extra point (accidental, from the 32768 driver attempt): a 5001-token
+`/v1/completions` prompt prefilled in 69426.0 ms = **72.03 tok/s**
+(5 chunks, server `prompt_ms`), consistent with the calibrated runs.
